  "stories": [
    {
      "story_id": "US-001",
      "revision_id": "R1",
      "title": "Beacon Prototype v2 升级为 Story-driven 高保真实现参考包",
      "priority": "high",
      "status": "accepted",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "AC-001",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Contract Compiler Input",
          "text": "`prototype plan/create` 必须消费结构化 story/prd blocks，并支持 route source、code source、baseline source，而不是仅依赖前几行扁平 preview",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260331T040127Z-edc8",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-03-31T10:59:38.765415+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-002",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "CJK-safe Parsing",
          "text": "contract parser 必须正确处理中文分号、中文冒号、换行列表、多段 block，不允许因为 `；` 等标点导致 jump/state/section 丢失",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260331T040127Z-edc8",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-03-31T10:59:38.765415+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-003",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Page Inventory",
          "text": "必须显式解析 `coverage_mode` 与 `page_inventory`；当 feature 声明 `all-existing-routes` 时，Beacon 需解析 required pages，而不是只渲染 archetype sections",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260331T040127Z-edc8",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-03-31T10:59:38.765415+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-004",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Page Spec",
          "text": "每个 required page 都必须生成 page-spec，至少包含 `page_id`、`intent`、`sections`、`primary_cta`、`states`、`route_targets`、`truth_notes`",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260331T040127Z-edc8",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-03-31T10:59:38.765415+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-005",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Hi-fi Output",
          "text": "每个 required page 都必须生成独立高保真页面/画布；当 contract 声明 `full-hi-fi` 时，不允许退回 `compact coverage`、结构化小画布或摘要式表格替代",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260331T040127Z-edc8",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-03-31T10:59:38.765415+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-006",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Baseline Protection",
          "text": "contract 可声明 `baseline_protection`；被保护页面不得退化为 generic shell，不得丢失既有有效交互与信息层级",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260331T040127Z-edc8",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-03-31T10:59:38.765415+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-007",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Route Closure",
          "text": "CTA/tab/page jumps 必须携带 target、context/params、fallback，并进入 `route-closure-contract.json` 与 `implementation-map.json`",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260331T040127Z-edc8",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-03-31T10:59:38.765415+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-008",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Shared Visual System",
          "text": "产物必须输出单一 `theme.json + tokens.css`，并显式声明页面只能消费共享 token，不允许 per-page 失控硬编码",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260331T040127Z-edc8",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-03-31T10:59:38.765415+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-009",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Review Strictness",
          "text": "`prototype review` 必须检查 page coverage、state coverage、compact-mode drift、baseline regression、route closure、artifact consistency、stale source",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260331T040127Z-edc8",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-03-31T10:59:38.765415+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-010",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Freeze Integrity",
          "text": "`prototype freeze` 仅在 `review=pass`、`stale=false`、manifest/freeze/review 自洽、artifact fingerprints 完整时允许通过",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260331T040127Z-edc8",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-03-31T10:59:38.765415+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-011",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Machine Consumers",
          "text": "`test-case/review/gate/implementation` 必须可消费 `prototype-plan.json`、`page-specs/`、coverage report、route closure 工件",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260331T040127Z-edc8",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-03-31T10:59:38.765415+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-012",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Real Fixture Coverage",
          "text": "`slow_uni_bmtop` 这类要求“38 页全高保真 + baseline protection + route closure”的 fixture 必须可被 truthful 表达",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260331T040127Z-edc8",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-03-31T10:59:38.765415+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-013",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Backward Compatibility",
          "text": "旧的 prototype 流程可继续使用 minimal mode，但 minimal mode 必须显式标记为不具备 `reference-pack-v2` 的强保证",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260331T040127Z-edc8",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-03-31T10:59:38.765415+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
